{"id":"641367","name":"煎包","author":"雪玥美食家","authorId":"12929721","desc":"","cover":"images/641367/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500g"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"茄子","amount":"3个"},{"name":"粉条","amount":"1把"},{"name":"葱","amount":"1颗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉加酵母，加温水，醒发两倍大。","img":"images/641367/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"茄子切丁加盐挤出水份。","img":"images/641367/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"泡好的粉条，加生抽拌匀。","img":"images/641367/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"茄子，粉条，葱花放一起，加鸡精，十三香，盐。","img":"images/641367/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蚝油。","img":"images/641367/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"泼热油。","img":"images/641367/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/641367/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"醒好的面揉面排气，分剂子。","img":"images/641367/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包上馅料。","img":"images/641367/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"底部煎金黄。","img":"images/641367/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"一勺面粉。","img":"images/641367/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加多半碗水，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/641367/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"把面粉水倒进去。","img":"images/641367/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"小煎包就好了。","img":"images/641367/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}